abstract: >-
  A small toolkit and write-up for applying HIP/CUDA graph capture to
  launch-bound recurrent, autograd-based training on AMD ROCm, including a
  capture-safe sparse-matmul replacement, device-cached constants, the
  static-buffer refactor for captured recurrent state, and minimal reproducers
  for the ROCm HIP-graph defects encountered along the way.
